parameters.description:
(Optional) This action retrieves leads with the specific status inside the campaign. Possible statuses and corresponding values are:
- [1] Discovered;
- [2] Connection pending;
- [3] Connected, not replied;
- Or, combine these values (e.g. [1,2]. In this case, you export leads’ statuses that match ANY value). 
You can export 3 additional statuses in combination with the ‘filterByConnectionDegree’ parameter. 
- filterByStatus = [4], filterByConnectionDegree = [1] - replied, connected;
- filterByStatus = [4], filterByConnectionDegree = [2, 3] - replied, not connected;
- filterByStatus = [4], filterByConnectionDegree does not exist - replied.

